# Facebook comment auto-replies

Owner: `lib/facebook-comment-reply.js`. Practiced answers live in `lockedFacebookAnswer()`. Do **not** send `whoIsJulieAnswer`, `ageCarrierFitAnswer`, carrier lists, or other website-chat canned copy into a public comment.

## Style

- First reply: thank them; automated assistant of Mejor Vida Seguros; Julie was notified and will **private-message**; then one short answer if they asked a question.
- Later replies: skip that intro. One short **usted** answer. “Si tiene otra pregunta, puede escribirla aquí.”
- Bare INFO / Information / REVISAR: intro only. No blog URL.
- No phones, emails, URLs, licensed-state roster, carrier shopping lists, or sample prices.

```js
// BAD — website chat
"Nació en Bogotá… https://…/about-julie.html Llámala al 402-440-5438"

// GOOD — Facebook comment
"Julie Braunsroth es la fundadora de Mejor Vida Seguros y una agente de seguros licenciada (NPN #21695431). Ella es quien le enviará el mensaje privado."
```
